  "interpretation": [
    "Both native Android and the prototype prune exact unused-icon counts; 81.9% was relative to CMP assets, not native Android.",
    "Benchmark uses the same Android Compose UI for both resource APIs; this is not a Compose versus Android Views app-size study.",
    "R.drawable consumes AAPT2-compiled XML; prototype R.raw keeps text XML for Compose byte/URI/qualifier semantics. Runtime/DEX and resource encoding differ.",
    "KMP Android consumers can benefit; stock CMP1.12.1 asset packaging is unchanged in production. No R8 claims for iOS/JVM/web or font glyph subsetting.",
    "Native dynamic map and CMP dynamic catalog retain all3802 entries; visually unused does not mean unreachable.",
    "The native comparison has six default release+shrunk builds plus six notice-normalized shrunk builds, all verified. Fresh device rendering and repeated timings were not rerun for the notice-only fixture change."
  ],
